  "notes": "{産|う}む means to give birth or produce something new.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: {子供|こども}を{産|う}む\n- Intransitive pair: {産|う}まれる (to be born)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{産|う}んでいる can mean \"is giving birth\" (in progress) or \"has given birth\" (resultant state, less common).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {子供|こども}を{産|う}む: to give birth to a child\n- {卵|たまご}を{産|う}む: to lay eggs\n- {利益|りえき}を{産|う}む: to generate profit (figurative)\n- アイデアを{産|う}む: to produce ideas\n\nKANJI VARIANTS:\n- {産|う}む: give birth, produce (standard)\n- {生|う}む: give birth (less common variant)\n\nRELATED:\n- {出産|しゅっさん}: childbirth\n- {産|う}まれる: to be born",
